DECISIONS 460, 461, API.md F12 (orchestrator ruling EVAL-AMENDNOTE): an amendment storing into a list element a negation whose value passes the 64-bit Int of expressions is E3201 on that Int, which names no declaration: the broken limit is no declared type's, so the finding has no related note, though the element's holder is a field.
-- layers --
dev
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// Config.
record Config {
  /// Ys.
  ys: [Int8] = [1, 2]
}

/// Config.
let config: Config = {}
-- a/dev.canon --
package a
layer dev

amend config {
  ys[0]: -(-9223372036854775808)
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3201]  a/dev.canon:5:10
  9223372036854775808 does not fit Int

